<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gannett upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gannett upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its near-term rating on Gannett Co Inc to accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The long-term rating remains a buy, Merrill said.</p>
<p>-- Gannett shares gained 1/8 to 75-1/8 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
